@startuml
title SwapCampus Core Subgraph: Supporting Domains

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam nodesep 90

hide methods
left to right direction

class "User" as User {
  +id
  +name
  +credit
}

package "Messaging and Governance" {
  class "Conversation" as Conversation {
    +id
    +updatedAt
  }

  class "Message" as Message {
    +id
    +type
    +content
  }

  class "Report" as Report {
    +id
    +reason
    +status
  }

  class "Audit Log" as AuditLog {
    +id
    +action
    +target
  }
}

package "Credit and Async" {
  class "Credit Asset" as UserCreditAsset {
    +userId
    +availablePoints
    +totalPoints
  }

  class "Point Ledger" as CreditPointLedger {
    +id
    +change
    +source
    +balance
  }

  class "Redeem Order" as CreditRedeemOrder {
    +id
    +reward
    +status
  }

  class "Outbox Event" as OutboxEvent {
    +id
    +topic
    +type
    +status
  }
}

User -[hidden]right- Conversation
Conversation -[hidden]down- Message
Conversation -[hidden]down- Report
Report -[hidden]down- AuditLog
User -[hidden]right- UserCreditAsset
UserCreditAsset -[hidden]down- CreditPointLedger
UserCreditAsset -[hidden]right- CreditRedeemOrder
CreditRedeemOrder -[hidden]down- OutboxEvent

User "1" -right- "0..*" Conversation : initiates / joins
Conversation "1" -down- "0..*" Message : contains
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" Report : reporter / target / handler
User "0..1" -[norank]right- "0..*" AuditLog : acts in

User "1" -down- "0..1" UserCreditAsset : owns
UserCreditAsset "1" -down- "0..*" CreditPointLedger : records
UserCreditAsset "1" -right- "0..*" CreditRedeemOrder : creates

note bottom of Conversation
A conversation may be
attached to a product,
product order, or
service order.
Those context entities
are omitted here.
end note

note bottom of Report
Reports may target
users, products, or
service listings.
Polymorphic targets
are not expanded here.
end note

note bottom of OutboxEvent
Outbox events capture
asynchronous side effects.
Products, orders, users,
and service listings may
all write here.
end note

@enduml
